# The build context is pb/. Neither of these belongs in the image:
#
# - pb_data is the database and every uploaded file. On the server it lives in
#   deploy/data/pb_data and is mounted; a local one must never be baked in.
# - pb_public/tutorials is about 130 MB of tutorial video. Built into the
#   image, every deploy would add another copy to the server's disk, so
#   deploy/docker-compose.yml mounts it from the checkout instead.
pb_data
pb_public/tutorials
